Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\b0}Save your tears{\b1} for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:42.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:57.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:23.94,Sign - Copy,,550,0,500,,{\b1}Beyond \N Paradise{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Formation B, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Continue to move through the first floor corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll lose them before they gain speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\b0}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:10.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:12.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ECM's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:15.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something must have gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:17.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All men, activate comm systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll pursue them in Formation A.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:33.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Proto. Can you lock the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:34.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry; I'm being an inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:42.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly, have there been\Nany reports from the Tachikomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:45.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, there were.\NThe nuclear sub has made no movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:48.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\b0}Also, the patro{\b1}l plane over\NDejima seems to have crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees shot it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't know the details, but probably yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That means we can make contact with Dejima, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:19.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Chief Cabinet Secretary\Ntold me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:32.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's a national emergency. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prime Minister, I came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:45.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief Aramaki needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:51.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:57.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sir, the MSDF's patrol plane\Nappears to have been shot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:02.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see. So he's trying to bring the\Nisolated refugees together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's about time for the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:11.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take command of the Ministry of Defence and\Nhave them begin shelling from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:20.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:21.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd like you to send out a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:25.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A letter, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Express delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:30.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma! Can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:32.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can, Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have confirmed your position!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:35.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San, you're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened to Batou and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:41.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They seem to be inside a building;\Nwe cannot get visual confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:43.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I found Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tell Batou and the others where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:48.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly, Major, there's big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:49.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:54.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An Imperial American nuclear submarine\Nis anchored off the Okinawan coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:58.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems they intend to fire\Na nuclear missile at Dejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:01.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Give me a visual feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:03.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:09.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:12.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why the hell did we bring this in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:16.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the inspection team's ETA?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:17.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:18.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:22.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you and the others must immediately\Ngo to the bridge with the plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:25.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They intend to use the nuclear missile\Nbefore the inspection team arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hand the plutonium to the SDF\Nguarding the bridge at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:30.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You need to get out of there, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're being tailed by a very\Npersistent bunch right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll move as fast as we can,\Nbut we might be cutting it pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 4 Rangers, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:44.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think they came after us\Nto retrieve the plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll rendezvous with you guys ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get away from them, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, yeah, we'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe this is our third,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,no, fourth meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you pursue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I went through a lot of trouble to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:21.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I brought the plutonium as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:25.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you don't, there will be great devastation,\Nincluding the deaths of the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:28.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not to mention, you'll be blamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:31.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A nuclear attack disguised as a\Nrefugee suicide bombing, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:36.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The nuclear sub's hatch has begun to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:54.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The nuclear missile could be fired any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the type that has\Na stratospheric trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:00.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It must be to ensure that there\Nwill be no witnesses to the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if they can remove the radiation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:07.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this has enough firepower to kill the\NSDF deployed in Nagasaki and Dejima!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:10.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:13.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can't we stop the attack somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:15.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How about broadcasting this\Nimage to the entire world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:17.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no point in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Images don't have any value as evidence anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It'd just end up as an entertaining image
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that came from an unknown\Nsource at an opportune time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But, but... if we don't do something...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey! Looks like the Aegis will begin\Nfiring missiles before the nuclear attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:48.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They caught up to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They must've changed the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Activate thermo-optical camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:58.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, can you find their\Nencrypted comm system and tap into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:00.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:04.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There will soon be a missile\Nattack from the Aegis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.05,0:09:07.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't think they'll attack the\Nresidential sectors directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:09.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I don't know where the missiles will land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about the nuclear missile?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds like it's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've also got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, it's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Come with me and surrender to the SDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll take you there by force if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:47.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:51.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am explaining the situation to the\Nrefugees who are currently connected to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:54.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll leave the final decision to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:55.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but for now, let's go to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:09.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, what are the missiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:46.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}It seems the SDF's counterattack has begun\Nin response to missile attacks from Dejima.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:46.90,Dialogue,,875,0,150,,{\b1}MSDF Air Raid on Dejima!!{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:48.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}According to the government,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:54.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}it is an unavoidable measure in order to ensure the\Nsafety of the UN inspection team when they enter Dejima.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:50.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:54.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, are the Major and the others safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Contact with the Major has been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San and the others are safe, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:00.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it Section 4 that's chasing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry for making you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:08.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I got so nervous just listening\Nto the Dejima situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What good does it do for you to get nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:13.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll do what we can, here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:38.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The attack seems to have died down for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, you're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:56.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The nuclear missile could be fired at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please evacuate at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Any statements from the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There was an announcement that provisional air raids will\Nbe repeated to allow the inspection team to enter, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:08.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:09.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:13.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. I'm trapped under a pile of rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:17.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems I must leave the rest\Nup to Batou and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:20.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh no! Can't you get out somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll try...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but provide full backup to Batou and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you connected to the refugees?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:33.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. A considerable number have re-linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:38.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,although most of them seem to be\Nin a panic due to the air raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You said there will be a nuclear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:48.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How did you hear about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Which organisation are you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:53.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:56.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While investigating the\NIndividual Eleven's crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we came across a programme within the government\Nthat was designed to eradicate the refugees
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:03.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and were pursuing you to expose the programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:05.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then why did you bring in the plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:09.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Because we knew you didn't get the plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, we seized the nuclear\Nbomb that was used in Fukuoka
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:17.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in an attempt to resolve the\Nsituation by using it as evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:21.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the enemy's scenario progressed\Nfar more rapidly than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:25.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We didn't think they'd secured a deal\Nwith the Empire for a nuclear strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened to the plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:31.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My team should be taking it to the SDF,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:35.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but that also has become difficult\Ndue to obstruction by a pursuing team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:36.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:40.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have you given up on making me surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I haven't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:05.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just took down the zoning and\Nfiltering on my hub cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:09.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone can connect and\Nobserve what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:16.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can attempt to evacuate, but I will also\Nproceed with my own revolution at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I became firm in my resolve after\Nhearing about the nuclear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean by revolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:30.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, you haven't tapped\Ninto their comm system yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, they keep randomly changing the\Nencryption based on prime numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:36.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:47.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's relocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:48.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:53.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, I need that tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:53.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:10.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze, why did you become the refugees leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:17.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How did you escape the virus thought\Nguidance effect in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:22.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I originally had a goal to liberate the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:26.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That resulted in activating\Nthe Individual Eleven virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:28.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but when I joined the Eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I realised the discrepancy\Nbetween their beliefs and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:33.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That must be why I could\Ndissociate myself from the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:36.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you want to liberate the refugees, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I heard you travelled in Eurasia;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:40.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,did that have something to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That... has no direct relation to my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:46.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I went on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:50.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,just because I wanted time to reaffirm my motives
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and to see whether I could execute the revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:55.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or liberation that I envisioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is this "revolution" that you speak of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:02.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The transfer of people to a superstructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:04.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What this means is that people\Nshould discard their rigid system
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:08.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and unite with the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unite with the net?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How is the cryptanalysis of the\NSection 4 comm system code going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:23.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mmm, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:26.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if we could manage\Nto hack the nuclear sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:33.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During an operation,\Nsubs are in standalone status.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about a crew member's personal email?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:38.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we could tap into a disobedient crew member...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:39.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:41.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, I brought her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Proto, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prime Minister Kayabuki, I see you are unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have been briefed on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:01.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could you set up a hotline\Nto the Empire in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:05.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll try to stop the nuclear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Whether they admit to this\Nsituation is key, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:11.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:27.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You are surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:32.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Put the plutonium down and deactivate\Nyour thermo-optical camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San! I have a tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right. We'll put it down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:40.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hit the walls as soon as I put the case down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:46.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Our fields of fire are overlapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm deactivating my thermo-optical camouflage now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:03.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you still feel you need to carry out the\Nmission after I do, go ahead and shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if you feel otherwise after seeing my\Nface, listen to what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your eyes. Are you an ex-Ranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Due to the incident on the Peninsula,\NI began to look at life philosophically.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I found a paradoxical order,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,exploitation by the strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and corrupt structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What disappointed me the most, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:43.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,was the irresponsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The masses don't try to\Ncreate anything on their own
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:48.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and don't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:50.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And yet, if they find information\Nconvenient to themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:54.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they rush to ingest it and\Nare therefore manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:58.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Without motives, they consume the\Ninfrastructure called the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their actions may bring irresponsible results,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:03.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but they feel no responsibility whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:07.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My revolution is also an act\Nof revenge against such people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.19,0:19:09.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've always felt a disparity\Nbetween my body and my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:16.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,because I've been a full cyborg since childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:20.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've always wanted to discard\Nthis inconvenient body if I could
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:23.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and set sail for the sea of the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:28.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Asian refugees gave someone\Nlike me a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:34.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They said that my man-made\Nface was a very good face
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and flattered me by saying my\Nghost is expressed within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I then realised, for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:45.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that the body and the mind may be indivisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and I was able to think of myself as\Na human being with a physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:51.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:55.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even these people went easily\Nin the direction of convenience
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:59.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,once they encountered palatable information.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:04.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems human beings were created to descend\Nto lower heights from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how do you propose to enact your revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:14.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will take the memories and ghosts of those\Nwho are connected to me away into the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:18.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If a nuclear bomb is dropped here,\Nthey will lose their physical bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.09,0:20:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but they will obtain a\Nchance to force an evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:26.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is the possibility that they can\Nretain their individuality on the net?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:33.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But as pioneers, they can become\Nentities that will enlighten those
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who remained in the infrastructure and make\Nthem continually aware of the superstructure,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:44.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in the same way man felt respect and terror\Ntowards spiritual entities in antiquity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So that's your revenge and salvation\Nfor the ones who disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, though I believe it to be a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You seem to be a full cyborg\Nfrom what I've observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If so, then you must have\Nexperienced the doubt--the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,disparity between the body and\Nthe mind--quite a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:12.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:24.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do the refugees intend to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:24.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:33.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,many of them would prefer to execute\Nthe nuclear suicide attack scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I suppose they wish to\Nbelieve that they didn't lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:42.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though that is an act that\Nleads them to lower heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:48.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm going to try to save the\Nrefugees with Kuze's method.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:55.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You tell the SDF about the nuclear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you copy, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not going to let you go by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:09.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not going to let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.01,0:22:24.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are they waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:25.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:27.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, let's take this to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:31.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The GSDF may believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.31,0:22:41.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Advance into Dejima as soon as\Nthe second air raid is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:44.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will prepare to accept the inspection team.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:21.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:25.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:39.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:47.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:49.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:55.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.99,0:23:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:04.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:06.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.53,0:24:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:15.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:17.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.85,0:24:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:22.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
